### Page 1 of 1

```text
Amendment from July 6, 2020 Finance Committee Meeting

RESOLUTION – Creating a Special District for ‘Cheyenne Days – Legendary Nights Events’,
July 17, 2020 to July 26, 2020, in which the possession of open containers is permitted within the
Downtown District Boundaries.
Amended by replacing 12 oz. cups with 16 oz. cups in item #3 in the final WHEREAS section and
by striking #1, “Paint Slingers 2020-Saturday, July 18, 2020 from 12:00 p.m. to 9:30 p.m. (alcohol
serving time-actual event times will be from 10:00 a.m. to 10:00 p.m.)” and renumbered under the
2nd WHEREAS section.
```
